«ENDIF»«ENDFOREACH-»

«FOREACH pNC.pNCConfigSet.sUM_PNC_PARTIAL_NETWORK_PARAMETER AS PartialNWPara ITERATOR i-»
 «IF (PartialNWPara.number_of_PNC_Activation_Signals != 0)»
